onderful.\n\nThe character I would like to request is Utaha Shiraishi from the Blue Archive.\nClothing is normal/variable or left up to you.\nExpression is,\nhttps://x.com/nijikunkamo/status/1794254501135937797?s=46&t=QeVgkE8aScfqxW8f45IC2Q\nI like this illustration very much, so please make her look embarrassed or something similar.\nPlease don't make the breasts too big. Composition and other details are up to you.\n\nThank you in advance.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nijikunkamo/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2657093, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/df34be9f/uploads/origins/ec2d1c7c-9efe-483e-a146-564460518594?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccba9b9e5eabbcbeb85693e5c031f1f6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df34be9f/uploads/origins/ec2d1c7c-9efe-483e-a146-564460518594?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccba9b9e5eabbcbeb85693e5c031f1f6, https://si.imgix.net/df34be9f/uploads/origins/ec2d1c7c-9efe-483e-a146-564460518594?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04521b85c14cde259b89d1d1a0982cfb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df34be9f/uploads/origins/ec2d1c7c-9efe-483e-a146-564460518594?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8336af21ae03764809fc12b6e4eeb26 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/df34be9f/uploads/origins/ec2d1c7c-9efe-483e-a146-564460518594?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f703064a2206e29ce1a749d2d63a3bf4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df34be9f/uploads/origins/ec2d1c7c-9efe-483e-a146-564460518594?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f70